1
00:00:00,666 --> 00:00:02,086
(Raj:)Ironic, isn't it?

2
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:08,590
[WHISPERS]
Elevator shaft.

3
00:00:12,344 --> 00:00:13,724
SHELDON:
Help me open it.

4
00:00:13,887 --> 00:00:17,267
(Howard:)Are you crazy? We can't go down
an empty elevator shaft.

5
00:00:17,474 --> 00:00:20,104
If you don't wanna proceed,
then you forfeit the bet...

6
00:00:20,269 --> 00:00:23,229
(Sheldon:)...and I'll take possession
of your Fantastic Four.

7
00:00:23,981 --> 00:00:25,981
(Howard:)Let's open her up.

8
00:00:26,984 --> 00:00:29,694
(Sheldon:)Are you bothered
that I can so easily manipulate you?

9
00:00:29,862 --> 00:00:31,242
HOWARD:
Don't push me, Sheldon.

10
00:00:32,031 --> 00:00:34,701
(Howard:)I may be small,
but I took kung fu when I was 13...

11
00:00:34,867 --> 00:00:37,407
(Howard:)...and I remember a good deal of it.

12
00:00:37,578 --> 00:00:38,708
(Sheldon:)Oh, really?

13
00:00:38,871 --> 00:00:42,211
(Sheldon:)I grew up with an older brother
and a very contentious twin sister.

14
00:00:42,374 --> 00:00:45,214
And I could easily best you
in any physical confrontation.

15
00:00:45,377 --> 00:00:49,047
(Sheldon:)Be it noogies, swirlies or the classic,
"Why are you hitting yourself?"

16
00:00:51,550 --> 00:01:00,020
(Raj:)Ooh. Big talk from a man who was once
treed by a chicken.

